A '''droidsmith workshop'''<ref name="Name">{{ThisWeek|LMp0i8tw_L4|From a Certain Point of View Cover Reveal, Star Wars Celebration LIVE!, and More!|sw_url=video/from-a-certain-point-of-view-cover-reveal-star-wars-celebration-live-and-more}}</ref> was ran by the [[Anzellan Droidsmiths]] on the [[Volcano|volcanic]] [[planet]] [[Nevarro]]. Around the time of the [[New Republic]], [[Din Djarin]] visited the workshop and asked the [[Anzellan]]s to help repair [[IG-11]]. [[Unidentified Anzellan|One]] of the Anzellans told the [[Mandalorian]] that the [[assassin droid]] needed a new [[memory circuit]], which was hard because the component was no longer being produced.<ref name="Chapter 17" />

